<title>UK: Total adds 800 mln French francs to 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>Total adds 800 mln French francs to 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was announced by lead manager Caisse des Depots et Consignations.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOTAL SA</p>
<p> AMT    800 MLN FRF   COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    25.OCT.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.31    PAY DATE    02.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    100.01    SPREAD	+21 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **FUNGIBLE WITH 950 MLN FRF BOND LAUNCHED 11.JUN.96.</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 5	   LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    HOME CTRY  FRANCE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.50 PCT OAT DUE 2008 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
